{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>To the Torah and to the testimony.</b> The lamed is like אמרי לי אחי הוא (Genesis 20:13), on account of the Torah of prophecy, for they will still say a thing like כדבר הזה לא נשמע, for it is like night that has no dawn, and the meaning is: this riddle will not come forth to light. And some say that the meaning of 'לתורה' is an oath, and a thing like this we have not seen in Scripture."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:54.056061190Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}